# No trailing slash: worktrees link these as symlinks.
node_modules
runs/
# play --public: the access key of the friends' link and their player IDs.
.lan/
# ./start: the downloaded cloudflared and its log.
.cache/
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
# What `bun run setup` builds from playtika/, or the user's own copy of the build: original files, bundles and
# extractions (CLAUDE.md, Safety and tools).
artifacts
# What the extractors in re/extract/ write (re/README.md).
/re/data
# The custom heroes' directories (heroes/README.md): only the private repository tracks them, and
# tests/unit/docs.test.ts fails if main does.
/heroes/files
# Notes about the custom heroes themselves (heroes/README.md): untracked on every branch.
/heroes/specifics.md
.claude/worktrees/
